tolome-keyboard-fon (0.1.1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Declare the "fon" layout in /usr/share/X11/xkb/rules/base.lst, the
    catalogue read by the Calamares keyboard page (it reads neither evdev.xml
    nor base.xml). The file of xkb-data is diverted (base.lst.distrib, always
    the original) and base.lst is regenerated from it with the "fon" line;
    a dpkg trigger redoes it after each xkb-data upgrade. Removing the
    package gives base.lst back to xkb-data.

 -- Anhky <dev@tolome.net>  Wed, 04 Nov 2026 11:00:00 +0100

